  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of the European Union&#xbf;s External Financing Instruments for the 2014-2020 and 2021-2021 Multiannual Financial Frameworks</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The European Commission is preparing a &lt;strong&gt;mid-term evaluation&lt;/strong&gt; (MTE) of the European Union External Financing Instruments (EFIs) under Heading 6 (Neighbourhood and the World) of the EU Multiannual Financial Framework (MFF) 2021-2027. Concurrently, and to inform the MTE, the European Commission must also undertake a &lt;strong&gt;final evaluation&lt;/strong&gt; of the relevant previous EFIs under Heading 4 (Global Europe) of the EU MFF 2014-2020, as it was foreseen by Article 17(1) of the EU Regulation 236/2014, as well as a final evaluation of the 11th European Development Fund (11th EDF).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The evaluations of these external financing instruments have been grouped together in one single process to meet the objectives of the mid-term and final evaluations and to better coordinate the exercise across the individual EFIs.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
